From: mscharged-port
Subject: Admit the original Hall of Fame trophy histories
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on 0630.

The Hall of Fame cup pages' trophy items (0-2) push the earned-history pages
66-74 through ShowHallOfFameTrophy once their unlock flag is set (cup won,
Golden Boot or Brick Wall award, recorded by CupManager::RecordCupUnlock and
AwardGoalTrophies). Without the flag the original locked popup stays in place.
A player who earns a trophy therefore reached a gated factory case.

Under the existing MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_HALL_OF_FAME admission, which
already compiles the whole SHHallOfFameHistory.cpp for the player cards (65),
move cases 66-74 (SHHallOfFameHistory with the history modes) into the admitted
set. Record selection, statistics/date formatting, images and scrolling stay
original; the history records are the native cup save data. The history image
names call CharacterInfo::GetName, which retail emits out of line; natively the
TU includes its header-inline definition so the module has no lazy import.

diff --git a/src/Game/FE/BaseGameSceneManager.cpp b/src/Game/FE/BaseGameSceneManager.cpp
